GIVEN `the transfer, domestication or continuance has become effective under this section` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the corporation continues its existence as a corporation of this State` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 390(f) Who holds or bears after the transfer, domestication or continuance`
`s 390(f) in whom the rights, privileges, powers, property, debts due and causes of action of the corporation remain vested` `the transfer, domestication or continuance has become effective under this section` `the corporation continues its existence as a corporation of this State` MEANS
    IF   `the transfer, domestication or continuance has become effective under this section`
    THEN JUST (IF `the corporation continues its existence as a corporation of this State`
               THEN `the resulting entity and also the corporation, for so long as the corporation continues its existence as a corporation of this State`
               ELSE `the resulting entity alone`)
    ELSE NOTHING

